<title>FINLAND: KEKKILA SWINGS TO 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KEKKILA SWINGS TO 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax			3.9 vs 5.6 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.30 vs 2.33 loss</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    0.50 vs nil</p>
<p> Net sales					  141.3 vs 129.4</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	15.9 vs 8.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				   6.6 vs 2.1 loss</p>
<p> Net profit					   2.6 vs 5.7 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish fertilisers and saplings</p>
<p>producer is Kekkila Oy.</p>
